{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1532008-is-the-yomi-world-correlating-to-the-abyss","id":1532008,"title":"Is the Yomi world correlating to the Abyss?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-03-05T06:02:47-08:00","id":1532008,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Is the Yomi world correlating to the Abyss?","content":"Is the Yomi world correlating to the Abyss from DTF?<br /> The Yomi world is supposedly the realm of the Yama Kings where they rule kingdoms, different hells.<br /> The question is if it's technically the Abyss? It's a bit weird because technically speaking the Abyss is the jail of the fallen, where they are imprisoned rather than rulers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25177-lirbo","name":"Lirbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25177_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-05T07:58:27-08:00","id":1532027,"title":"","content":"As far as I understood it, Yomi and the DtF-Abyss are separate realms- <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar23890_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"23890\" data-vbnamecard=\"23890\">Shadeprowler</a> gave me a nice overview <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/1516811-wraith-dark-ages-history?p=1525107#post1525107\">here</a> and would know better than me since they are more familiar with both settings, but I read it as &quot;separate but connected&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","name":"voidshaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-05T08:07:49-08:00","id":1532029,"title":"","content":"Yomi is basically a sub-Realm created by the Yama Kings. They ripped up sections of the Yin and Yang worlds (the Underworld and the Umbra) and stitched them together to create their Hells. The Abyss of Demon the Fallen is a completely different place. It's been hinted that it's the Abyss that the Lasombra interact with, and it might be Oblivion itself, or inside of Oblivion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-06T11:49:53-08:00","id":1532092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1532008-is-the-yomi-world-correlating-to-the-abyss?p=1532029#post1532029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yomi is basically a sub-Realm created by the Yama Kings. They ripped up sections of the Yin and Yang worlds (the Underworld and the Umbra) and stitched them together to create their Hells. The Abyss of Demon the Fallen is a completely different place. It's been hinted that it's the Abyss that the Lasombra interact with, and it might be Oblivion itself, or inside of Oblivion.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's my understanding, too: the Abyss of Obtenebration is Oblivion and it's the prison of DtF. The Underworld is a realm above Oblivion made by certain groups of demons early on.<br /> <br /> \u0130 would add that the whole idea of the oubliettes makes sense if one looks at them as similar to the prisons demons are in. And the Lasombra's meddling with faith and the church, etc. makes extra sense if there is a link with the demons of DtF.<br /> <br /> \u0130 also take Apep/Apophis as being Oblivion or linked to it, and Serpentis as a discipline coming from it rather than a specialised version of Protean. \u0130t follows that \u0130 link both Setites and Lasombra to demons, but in a much subtler way than the Baali. The emphasis on faith in both clans also makes sense with DtF.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16965-hermeticus","name":"Hermeticus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-14T22:03:50-07:00","id":1535611,"title":"","content":"There are at least four places called Abyss in the cosmology. Their relationship is not given, so they may be related or not, ST's choice:<br /> <br /> 1- DtF Abyss, prison of the Fallen;<br /> 2- Middle Umbra Abyss, source of Harano;<br /> 3- Obtenebration's Abyss, lovecraftian realm;<br /> 4- The Oblivion, bottom of the worlds.<br /> <br /> You can work any relationship you want between them, all of them have been hinted at some moment to be related or the same realm as each of the others.<br /> <br /> But all those hints include good reasons to take them with a grain of salt, specially because they don't really fill similar roles or work together in any capacity.<br /> <br /> Unless you want to specifically unveil such secrets in your game, they work just fine as distinct things and any relationship is mere theory, discussion fodder, with no actual effect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T03:35:41-07:00","id":1535624,"title":"","content":"Doesn't V5 make it canon that Obtenebration's Abyss is the same as Oblivion? \u0130 haven't read the manual, \u0130 just gathered as much from the fact that Necromancy and Obtenebration are now connected to each other by Oblivion.<br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16965-hermeticus","name":"Hermeticus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T03:39:25-07:00","id":1535625,"title":"","content":"\u0130t's worth noting that the Underworld of Wraith includes realms and creatures that resemble various cultures' Paradises and Hells, while they are not technically the &quot;real&quot; Paradise and Hell because the whole gig with the Underworld is that it's a fake realm built by demons to &quot;save&quot; human souls from disappearing into whatever destination God had intended for them after death, beyond the demons' perception and reach.<br /> This seems to support the idea of Yomi as one such realm in the Underworld, or consisting of a mix of Underworld and Umbra.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16965-hermeticus","name":"Hermeticus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T05:04:16-07:00","id":1535633,"title":"","content":"The general idea I'm working with is to make a distinction between realms of the Inner Darkness and realms of the Outer Darkness. That is, if we look at the Umbra as if it were a lens to focus emotions, faith, ideas, dreams, and all the other abstract stuff there are two ways for this to happen:<br /> <br /> 1. Mundus projects into the Umbra, which creates Spirits, Demons, Ghosts, Gods and whatnot as ephemeral representations of those concepts.<br /> <br /> 2. Something from outside projects <i>into </i>Mundus. This would be all the eldritch things- Neverborn, the Children, things from outside our universe.<br /> <br /> The canvas for these realms is the primordial dark, ie the biblical Tehom or whatever you want to call a Nothing that can Create. Around and between everything flows Oblivion, the absence of everything, null, the as-Nothing-as-it-gets.<br /> <br /> I'm actually writing a Baali NPC at the moment who made a science of the layers of Dark and how to access them. The V5 version of the Oblivion discipline irks me because it conflates both concepts of inner and outer realms by way of combining Necromancy and Obtenebration. For a V20 variant, I would rather combine Obtenebration, Nihilistics, Daimonion, and some of the Dark Thauma paths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","name":"voidshaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T15:26:19-07:00","id":1535685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hermeticus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1532008-is-the-yomi-world-correlating-to-the-abyss?p=1535624#post1535624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Doesn't V5 make it canon that Obtenebration's Abyss is the same as Oblivion? \u0130 haven't read the manual, \u0130 just gathered as much from the fact that Necromancy and Obtenebration are now connected to each other by Oblivion.<br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>No.<br /> <br /> It's just that the new Discipline is called Oblivion.<br /> <br /> V5 makes no mention to the Oblivion from Wraith, or to any aspect of any cosmology. It makes no assumptions as to why those different powers come from the same Discipline.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}